Fix  $B$  and  $C$  on the complex plane with  $B=-\dfrac{1}{\sqrt{3}}$  and  $C=\dfrac{1}{\sqrt{3}}$ . Now note that this gives  $MA=MB\sqrt{3}=1$ . So  $A$  lies on the unitcircle.

