Note that quadrilateral  $ADPC$  is cyclic since  $\angle ADC = \angle APC = 90^\circ$ . Because  $ABM \sim QPM$  and  $ACM \sim DPM$  with the same ratio of similitude  $\frac{\frac{1}{2} BC}{MP}$ , \[\frac{DM}{CM}=\frac{MQ}{BM} \implies DM=MQ.\]</details>

