Turbo will begin by exploring each column in turn. In each subsequent column, he will visit all the squares he visited in the previous column except for the endpoints. This is showcased in the following diagram for a grid with  $10$  rows and  $9$  columns. He will continue this process until he either runs into a monster or visits all the prescribed cells.

